[38;2;124;124;124m- Equicontinuity + pointwise convergence on compact sets gives uniform [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mconvergence, and this works for nets too (finite cover + directed set property).[0m
[38;2;124;124;124mSo actually the result should hold for nets as well. But I've seen statements [0m
